   {
    "id": "kiyoka",
    "category": "eat",
    "name": {
     "en": "Kiyoka",
     "ja": "沖縄料理本店 きよ香"
    },
    "about": {
     "en": "Opened in 1961 by a woman from Ishigaki, when Tokyo had only a handful of Okinawan restaurants: the root of Kōenji's Okinawan food. Her son still cooks her home recipes.",
     "ja": "1961年、石垣島出身の女性が開いた沖縄料理店。都内にまだ数店しかなかった頃で、高円寺の沖縄料理のルーツ。今は息子が母の味を守る。"
    },
    "location": [
